OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA much cooler and windier day
OL,6,Ftoday with westerly winds perhaps
OL,7,Fgusting to gale force over higher
OL,8,Fground. Often cloudy with showers for
OL,9,Fsome and perhaps more general rain at
OL,10,Ftimes, especially towards the north
OL,11,Fand west of the region.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining rather cloudy
OL,14,Fovernight with some occasional
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain moving across the
OL,16,Farea. Staying windy at first, but
OL,17,Fbeginning to ease later in the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
