OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA rather grey and damp start
OL,6,Fwith some further outbreaks of rain.
OL,7,FTurning drier into the afternoon with
OL,8,Fsome brightness developing. Winds
OL,9,Fcontinuing to ease but remaining
OL,10,Frather cool.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLargely
OL,13,Fdry with sunny spells on Friday and
OL,14,FSaturday. In the sunshine it will be
OL,15,Ffeeling increasingly warmer, before a
OL,16,Frisk of some rain returns by Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
